#
# A directory import resolves by listing the directory, which is impossible
# over HTTP - so a lab served by the Web Dojo needs its types named here.
# Harmless on the desktop, where Qt scans the directory either way.
#
# One scene per aspect of a character. Every one of them is a Node that
# answers the same contract (README.md, "The scene contract"), so a lab can
# load any of them into its View3D and drive it the same way.
Lineup 1.0 Lineup.qml
GaitSheet 1.0 GaitSheet.qml
GestureSheet 1.0 GestureSheet.qml
ActionStage 1.0 ActionStage.qml
MoveSheet 1.0 MoveSheet.qml
HandBench 1.0 HandBench.qml
FaceSheet 1.0 FaceSheet.qml
HeadRow 1.0 HeadRow.qml
SpeechRow 1.0 SpeechRow.qml
ConversationStage 1.0 ConversationStage.qml
CrowdField 1.0 CrowdField.qml
